# ============================================================
# Keep These Files
# ============================================================

# Keep empty directories
!.gitkeep

# Keep documentation
!README.md
!docs/*.md
!examples/README.md

# Keep configuration files
!requirements.txt
!setup.sh
!.gitignore

# Keep source code
!*.py
!*.ipynb

# ============================================================
# Optional: Uncomment to track large files with Git LFS
# ============================================================

# If you use Git LFS for large files, configure:
# git lfs track "models/*.h5"
# git lfs track "data/*.zip"

# ============================================================
# Notes
# ============================================================

# This .gitignore excludes:
# 1. Dataset (download from Kaggle separately)
# 2. Trained models (train locally or download from releases)
# 3. Virtual environments (create with: python -m venv venv)
# 4. IDE and OS specific files
# 5. Credentials and secrets
#
# To download dataset:
#   kaggle datasets download -d paultimothymooney/kermany2018
#
# To train model:
#   jupyter notebook notebooks/oct_classification.ipynb
#
# See README.md and docs/ for complete setup instructions
